  {
   "id": "the-holy-gosh-darn-240644@1.1.2",
   "gameId": "the-holy-gosh-darn-240644",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-02T11:09:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Here it is, the long awaited nutsack update! We finally fixed the biggest issue in the game so far, along with some other small stuff.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The patch notes do contain some spoilers, so be warned!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added New Game ++. Creating a new save in slot nr. 4 will now create a save where you start at the very end of act 1. This is purely for those wishing to hunt for achievements. PS: You will not be able to get the \"...of Efficiency\" achievement in this mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made the achievement \"...of Paradoxicality\" less missable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made the achievement \"...of Hostility\" less missable by allowing players to brew themselves a cup of gods coffee in act 3. This will only work with a save file that has not reached act 3 yet.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Defusing the bombs and then traveling back in time to a point just after the bombs were defused leading to the bombs not being defused anymore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Giving Elder 7 a cup of coffee and then leaving to get another cup for him in the same timeline should now work as expected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some minor one-off lines being said more than once.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Edge case where the player was unable to speak to Pesto and Bjørn.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ensured cosmetic items you only ever need to have one of, are not picked up multiple times. Even though it's funny to pick up 1000 demon horns, it does make it a little bit of a hassle to navigate your inventory.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Texture issue in god's house where toilet scrolls did not look like scrolls.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed awkward transition to God's House backyard, some players ended up immediately teleporting back where they came from.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Elder 4 responding to Cassiel before she starts knocking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Russian translation now says \"Last Tuesday\", instead of \"Last Thursday\" - which was a wholly uneventful day for everyone.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Norwegian translation has been improved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Satan's e-mail address is now his actual email address. We're really sorry Person-trying-to-live-your-life-and-not-get-tons-of-mails-addressed-to-Satan.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Opening the vault door and then going back in time to when Cassiel mentions that it takes an hour, leads to player movement being locked.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Annoying Ananiel until he leaves did not work.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Inner vault lock now remembers where it was in its animation when going back in time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Mark Atherlay's name in the credits, we don't know who Mike is.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sweary should now properly appear every time Gabriel says nutsack.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed various typos on Cassiels ID card",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can no longer exit the coffee machine mini game after clicking the \"on\" button. The minigame will end on its own when it's good and ready, preventing strange situations where the portal to hell does not appear as expected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved coffee machine \"on\" button hitboxes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
